  "html": "<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:252px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Balzack.png\" title=\"Balzack\"><img alt=\"Balzack\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"269\" src=\"/images/recovered/Balzack.png\" width=\"250\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/recovered/Balzack.png\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Balzack</div></div></div>\n<p>Balzack is a giant winged snake.  He is the Boss of Balzack's Burrow. He has strong toxic spells and a knockback that can one shot most characers.  He is accompanied by many poison Champions and mobs.\n</p><p>For tips on fighting Balzack see\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/Boss_Guide\" title=\"Boss Guide\">Boss Guide</a>\n</p>\n\n \n<p>The chest in this lair can roll a short list of named rainbows. Those pieces are on <a href=\"/wiki/Boss_Lair_Rainbows\" title=\"Boss Lair Rainbows\">Boss Lair Rainbows</a>.</p>\n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
}
